# Text is checked out with LF on every platform. Build scripts and tests read resource and data files byte for byte
# (third_party/unicode-math/src/build.rs matches "\n" between two HTML table rows; tests/fixtures, the intro script and
# the snapshots are compared with text generated on the machine), and Git for Windows would otherwise check them out
# with CRLF (core.autocrlf=true on the hosted runners). `eol=lf` overrides core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never converted.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.gz binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.der binary
*.loro binary
*.wasm binary

# Upstream licence texts, kept byte for byte (these two ship with CRLF).
crates/typeset/assets/licenses/*OFL*.txt -text
